## Port
## Port host
| Service | Port host | Catatan |
|---|---|---|
| web (nginx) | `3000` | halaman placeholder; `/api/` di-proxy ke api |
| api | `8080` | `/healthz` |
| mosquitto | `8883` | MQTT TLS untuk perangkat fisik; CA di `deploy/certs/ca.crt` |
| mosquitto 1883 | tidak dipublikasikan | hanya jaringan compose (ingest, simulator) |
| timescaledb | `127.0.0.1:5432` | dev saja |
| simulator (profile `sim`) | `127.0.0.1:8090` | HTTP kontrol skenario |
| prometheus (profile `obs`) | `127.0.0.1:9090` | |
| grafana (profile `obs`) | `127.0.0.1:3001` | user `admin`, password `GRAFANA_ADMIN_PASSWORD` |
| ingest / alerter / anomaly | internal `8081` / `8082` / `8083` | `/healthz` hanya dari jaringan compose |

